<title>ITALY: Italy's Edison names Del Ninno new MD.</title>
<headline>Italy's Edison names Del Ninno new MD.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Edison, the energy arm of Italian agri-industrial group Montedison, said in a statement it had named Giulio Del Ninno as its new managing director to replace Giancarlo Cimoli.</p>
<p>Del Ninno joined Edison in 1988 as director of Edison's electricity sector, later becoming managing director and chairman of Edison Termoelettrica Spa.</p>
<p>Cimoli is moving to be managing director of Italian state railway Ferrovie dello Stato Spa.</p>
<p>--Milan bureau +392 66129507</p>
</text>
